ghbors."}],href:"#contact-sales",action:"Contact Sales"},{id:"3",title:"Transparent, Local Billing in Naira",features:[{id:1,description:"Avoid foreign exchange risks and hidden charges. Enjoy predictable pricing in NGN with clear usage breakdowns that simplify budgeting and cost control."}],href:"#contact-sales",action:"Contact Sales"},{id:"4",title:"The Right Compute for Every Workload",features:[{id:1,description:"From lightweight general-purpose VMs to high-performance Bare Metal servers, we give you the flexibility to deploy what you need, when you need it. Whether it’s a simple app, a mission-critical database, or a regulated workload, we’ve got the right compute for you"}],href:"#contact-sales",action:"Contact Sales"},{id:"5",title:"Developer-Ready, Enterprise-Smart",features:[{id:1,description:"Whether you’re running CI/CD pipelines or mission-critical systems, our platform gives you the speed, tools, and local support to build and scale with confidence."}],href:"#contact-sales",action:"Contact Sales"}],"whyChooseNetworking",0,[{id:"1",title:"Low Latency, High Performance ",features:[{id:1,description:"Run latency-sensitive workloads closer to your users. Our network is built for speed, with peering across major ISPs and in-country Availability zones that deliver low latency for lightning-fast experiences."}],href:"#contact-sales",action:"Contact Sales"},{id:"2",title:"Performance Optimized ",features:[{id:1,description:"Leverage MTN’s connectivity infrastructure for low-latency connections and high throughput between zones or on-prem locations. "}],href:"#contact-sales",action:"Contact Sales"},{id:"3",title:"Local Expertise, Global Standards ",features:[{id:1,description:"Benefit from MTN’s in-country support and deep telco experience while enjoying cloud-native networking services that meet international benchmarks. "}],href:"#contact-sales",action:"Contact Sales"},{id:"4",title:"The Right Compute for Every Workload",features:[{id:1,description:"From lightweight general-purpose VMs to high-performance Bare Metal servers, we give you the flexibility to deploy what you need, when you need it. Whether it’s a simple app, a mission-critical database, or a regulated workload, we’ve got the right compute for you"}],href:"#contact-sales",action:"Contact Sales"}],"whyChooseStorage",0,[{id:"1",title:"Local Storage, Global Performance ",features:[{id:1,description:"Your data is hosted within NIgeria across multiple MTN data centres, delivering low-latency access while meeting data residency requirements. "}],href:"#contact-sales",action:"Contact Sales"},{id:"2",title:"Built for Mission-Critical Workloads ",features:[{id:1,description:"Our high durability and availability means your apps and backups are safe and accessible on demand."}],href:"#contact-sales",action:"Contact Sales"},{id:"3",title:"Pay-As-You-Grow ",features:[{id:1,description:"No upfront capital costs. Only pay for what you consume, with predictable and transparent local billing in Naira. "}],href:"#contact-sales",action:"Contact Sales"},{id:"4",title:"Seamless Integration ",features:[{id:1,description:"Our storage options integrate seamlessly with your MTN Cloud VMs, bare metal servers, and cloud native services. No complex setup needed. "}],href:"#contact-sales",action:"Contact Sales"}],"whyMTNCloud",0,[{id:"1",title:"Local Infrastructure, Global Standards",features:[{id:1,description:"Hosted in Tier III-certified MTN data centers across Nigeria."},{id:2,description:"Ensures data sovereignty, low latency, and compliance with local regulations."}],href:"#contact-sales",action:"Contact Sales"},{id:"2",title:"Enterprise-Grade Security & Compliance",features:[{id:1,description:"Multi-layered security controls including encryption at rest/in transit."},{id:2,description:"24/7 Security Monitoring and DDoS protection."},{id:3,description:"Compliance Support: Assistance for ISO 27001, NDPR, and industry-specific standards."}],href:"#contact-sales",action:"Contact Sales